sre-bot: quick check completed: cluster-autoscaler metrics and baseline requests look healthy in staging; no immediate oom spikes.

maria: Can you open a PR with the changes and tag me + jamal + liz? Add a rollout playbook note that includes rollback steps (revert taint + HPA policy).

alex: Will do. I'll open PR shortly (https://github.com/redwood-inference/infra/pull/2123) and attach the playbook. Planning to roll to staging first and monitor for 2 hours, then prod if green. If no objections I'll land after 14:00 PDT today.

liz: I'll prepare the IAM/SecureParameter changes and post the CloudTrail check list.

jamal: I'll watch autoscaler metrics and set a temporary alert on node churn.

maria: ACK. Thanks — please ping here when the PR is up.

